        "filing_date": "2026-03-31",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Collectively, we have had access to over 2,000 slot titles through our IP License Agreement with IGT and our partnership with DUG and we have internally developed a proprietary catalogue of over 190 original slot titles.",
